\" y1=\"229.09114927344783\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"229.09114927344783\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"59.381076233183855,344.457399103139 84.64315789473685,300.57894736842104 141.00846153846152,279.3333333333333 233.08249999999998,285.94444444444446 333.5715492957747,182.056338028169 406.846835443038,77.8987341772152\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 10% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 223 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"59.381076233183855\" cy=\"344.457399103139\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 8%&amp;#10;It rained 22% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 76 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"84.64315789473685\" cy=\"300.57894736842104\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 23%&amp;#10;It rained 28% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"141.00846153846152\" cy=\"279.3333333333333\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 49%&amp;#10;It rained 26% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 72 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"233.08249999999998\" cy=\"285.94444444444446\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 78%&amp;#10;It rained 55% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 71 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"333.5715492957747\" cy=\"182.056338028169\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 84% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 237 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"406.846835443038\" cy=\"77.8987341772152\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(42%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Umea the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.34) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (0.11).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>53%</td><td class='num'>0.108</td><td class='num'>18.3%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>48%</td><td class='num'>0.279</td><td class='num'>11.2%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>27%</td><td class='num'>0.324</td><td class='num'>10.5%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>44%</td><td class='num'>0.335</td><td class='num'>11.2%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":63.82842,"lon":20.25972,"n":757,"n_cities":213,"name":"Umea","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.04,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0039013452914798213,"n":223,"obs":0.1031390134529148,"sig":true},{"hi":0.14,"lo":0.04,"mean":0.07526315789473684,"n":76,"obs":0.2236842105263158,"sig":t